    {
      "id": "mmulc1u7sl9wv2r76or",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 85,
      "y": 85,
      "text": "一句话结论：先做 GTM 口径可对齐看板，用「销售额→营收→毛利」链路拆开差异；当月财务缺值时只展示占比 Benchmark，取不到用占比估算先跑 1~2 月再迭代。",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "createdAt": "2026-03-17T12:30:40.983Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-17T12:30:40.983Z",
      "version": 1,
      "fontFamily": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "mmulc1u7xki1vpf6vde",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 165,
      "strokeColor": "#111827",
      "text": "背景",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "createdAt": "2026-03-17T12:30:40.983Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-17T12:30:40.983Z",
      "version": 1,
      "fontFamily": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "mmulc1u7ghmdkr6q5ji",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 190,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 100,
      "backgroundColor": "#FEE2E2",
      "strokeColor": "#EF4444",
      "createdAt": "2026-03-17T12:30:40.983Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-17T12:30:40.983Z",
      "version": 1,
      "roughness": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "mmulc1u7lkj22rvm5ks",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 85,
      "y": 210,
      "text": "· 管理层预期与财报差距大（曾差约1300万级）\n· 业务实时 vs 财务上月结账，时间错位\n· 销售额→营收→毛利扣减项拆不开，差异难定位",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "createdAt": "2026-03-17T12:30:40.983Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-17T12:30:40.983Z",
      "version": 1,
      "fontFamily": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "mmulc1u7p4bq5hk1x89",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 165,
      "strokeColor": "#111827",
      "text": "目标",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "createdAt": "2026-03-17T12:30:40.983Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-17T12:30:40.983Z",
      "version": 1,
      "fontFamily": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "mmulc1u7tj0bfbneqni",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 190,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 100,
      "backgroundColor": "#DCFCE7",
      "strokeColor": "#16A34A",
      "createdAt": "2026-03-17T12:30:40.983Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-17T12:30:40.983Z",
      "version": 1,
      "roughness": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "mmulc1u7qpjshy61zs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 525,
      "y": 210,
      "text": "· 等不到财报时先做相对准确、可解释的全渠道报表\n· 偏差刷小、差异可定位\n· 与财务口径对齐，避免预期与实际大幅背离",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "createdAt": "2026-03-17T12:30:40.983Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-17T12:30:40.983Z",
      "version": 1,
      "fontFamily": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "mmulc1u7vpu55zznh7q",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 315,
      "strokeColor": "#111827",
      "text": "核心逻辑（自上而下口径链路）",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "createdAt": "2026-03-17T12:30:40.983Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-17T12:30:40.983Z",
      "version": 1,
      "fontFamily": 1
    },
